                <head>BATTLE OF SANTA ROSA—BLOODY FIGHTING.</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">official dispatch.</hi></p>
                <p>The rebellion may now be considered as suppressed all over the republic. Colonel
                    Roca has defeated General Arredondo, taking him and his army prisoners. The
